; Examples used for the Evaluation of AProVE in the Paper
; "Disproving (Positive) Almost-Sure Termination of
; Probabilistic Term Rewriting via Random Walks"
; Published in Proc. IJCAR'26

; Example that requires counting pumping substitutions.
; Needs a pumping substitution that considers multiple arguments.
; Needs to count not only orthogonal occurrences.

(format PTRS)

(fun f 1)
(fun g 1)
(fun c 3)

(prule (c z (f x) (g y)) (((c (c z (f x) (g y)) y x) :prob 1) ((c z (f (g y)) (g (f x))) :prob 1)))
